{
  "script_id": "monkey-saddle",
  "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
  "voice_key": "yunxi",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "monkey-saddle",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/monkey-saddle/yunxi/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.6,
      "size": 57600,
      "text": "普通的马鞍面有两个下坡，正好放骑手的两条腿。但如果骑手是一只猴子，它还有一条尾巴，得再来一个下坡。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "monkey-saddle",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/monkey-saddle/yunxi/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.85,
      "size": 45648,
      "text": "满足这个要求的曲面叫猴鞍面，方程是 x 的三次方减去三倍的 x 乘 y 的平方。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "monkey-saddle",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/monkey-saddle/yunxi/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.73,
      "size": 59760,
      "text": "它有三个上坡三个下坡交替排列。但这张面的真正价值不在形状，而在它揭示的一个重要数学事实。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "monkey-saddle",
      "section_id": "polar",
      "line_id": "pl-1",
      "filename": "polar-pl-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/monkey-saddle/yunxi/polar-pl-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.91,
      "size": 62496,
      "text": "直角坐标形式看不出对称性。换成极坐标后，方程变得极其干净：z 等于半径的三次方乘以余弦三倍角。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "monkey-saddle",
      "section_id": "polar",
      "line_id": "pl-2",
      "filename": "polar-pl-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/monkey-saddle/yunxi/polar-pl-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.35,
      "size": 69552,
      "text": "这个形式一眼就能看出三重对称。角度每转一百二十度，余弦三倍角完全复原，所以曲面转一百二十度和原来一样。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "monkey-saddle",
      "section_id": "polar",
      "line_id": "pl-3",
      "filename": "polar-pl-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/monkey-saddle/yunxi/polar-pl-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.91,
      "size": 62496,
      "text": "角度每转六十度，余弦三倍角变号，也就是上坡变下坡。转一整圈符号变化六次，正好三上三下。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "monkey-saddle",
      "section_id": "degenerate",
      "line_id": "dg-1",
      "filename": "degenerate-dg-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/monkey-saddle/yunxi/degenerate-dg-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.04,
      "size": 64656,
      "text": "现在说重点。判断一个临界点是极大、极小还是鞍点，标准方法是看二阶偏导构成的 Hesse 矩阵的行列式。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "monkey-saddle",
      "section_id": "degenerate",
      "line_id": "dg-2",
      "filename": "degenerate-dg-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/monkey-saddle/yunxi/degenerate-dg-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.0,
      "size": 47952,
      "text": "对普通鞍面，原点处这个行列式等于负四，小于零，判定为鞍点，一切正常。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "monkey-saddle",
      "section_id": "degenerate",
      "line_id": "dg-3",
      "filename": "degenerate-dg-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/monkey-saddle/yunxi/degenerate-dg-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.06,
      "size": 64944,
      "text": "但对猴鞍面，原点处的 Hesse 矩阵三个分量全是零，行列式也是零。二阶判别法给不出任何结论，彻底失效了。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "monkey-saddle",
      "section_id": "higher",
      "line_id": "hg-1",
      "filename": "higher-hg-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/monkey-saddle/yunxi/higher-hg-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.55,
      "size": 56736,
      "text": "为什么会这样？因为猴鞍面的最低次项是三次的。泰勒展开到二阶时，所有二阶项的系数都是零。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "monkey-saddle",
      "section_id": "higher",
      "line_id": "hg-2",
      "filename": "higher-hg-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/monkey-saddle/yunxi/higher-hg-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.23,
      "size": 51696,
      "text": "要判断原点的性质，必须展开到三阶。这类临界点叫退化临界点，是奇点理论研究的起点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "monkey-saddle",
      "section_id": "higher",
      "line_id": "hg-3",
      "filename": "higher-hg-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/monkey-saddle/yunxi/higher-hg-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.92,
      "size": 46656,
      "text": "猴鞍面因此成了教科书上最标准的例子，专门用来说明二阶判别法有它的适用边界。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "monkey-saddle",
      "section_id": "general",
      "line_id": "gn-1",
      "filename": "general-gn-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/monkey-saddle/yunxi/general-gn-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.07,
      "size": 49104,
      "text": "这个构造可以推广。取复数 x 加 i y 的 n 次方，只留实部，就得到 n 重鞍面。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "monkey-saddle",
      "section_id": "general",
      "line_id": "gn-2",
      "filename": "general-gn-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/monkey-saddle/yunxi/general-gn-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.98,
      "size": 63648,
      "text": "请切换重数观察。n 等于二是普通鞍面，两上两下；n 等于三是猴鞍面；n 等于四则有四上四下。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "monkey-saddle",
      "section_id": "general",
      "line_id": "gn-3",
      "filename": "general-gn-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/monkey-saddle/yunxi/general-gn-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.83,
      "size": 61344,
      "text": "留意 Hesse 行列式读数：只有 n 等于二时它不为零。n 大于等于三时最低次项高于二次，判别法一律失效。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "monkey-saddle",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/monkey-saddle/yunxi/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.02,
      "size": 48384,
      "text": "第一，猴鞍面有三个上坡三个下坡，极坐标下是半径三次方乘余弦三倍角。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "monkey-saddle",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/monkey-saddle/yunxi/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.79,
      "size": 44640,
      "text": "第二，它在原点处 Hesse 矩阵全为零，二阶判别法失效，必须看三阶项。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "monkey-saddle",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/monkey-saddle/yunxi/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.13,
      "size": 50112,
      "text": "第三，复数的 n 次方取实部给出 n 重鞍面的统一构造。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
